     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\"><strong>What</strong>: I had a vote for  Markdown and two votes for git, so it seems like I’ll be talking about  “Workflow with git“. Admittedly, this is not R-specific, but integration  with Rstudio makes the entry-effort a little easier. I’ll discuss some  of the basic concepts of version control (e.g., commit, diff, branch,  fork) and basic workflow from starting a new repo to doing some remote  work (think collaboration, Github, etc). There are more discussion  points about git in regards to deployment considerations, but that may  be too much for this first discussion (and often not important to many  in academia).</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\"><strong>Where</strong>: <strike>TBD</strike> <span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Active Decision Support, 380 Foam Street, Suite 210, Monterey</span>. There is <em>some</em> parking in the parking lot, but plan on parking on Foam or Drake (metered parking). See the next post for directions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\"><strong>When</strong>: Thursday, June 4, <strike>probably</strike> <span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">5:30</span> <strike>depending on the venue</strike>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\"><strong>Why</strong>: <em>R</em> and pizza, of course.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PHAgc3R5bGU9Im1hcmdpbjowcHggMHB4IDEu\r\nMmVtIWltcG9ydGFudCI+KipXaGF0Kio6IEkgaGFkIGEgdm90ZSBmb3IKIE1hcmtkb3duIGFuZCB0\r\nd28gdm90ZXMgZm9yIGdpdCwgc28gaXQgc2VlbXMgbGlrZSBJ4oCZbGwgYmUgdGFsa2luZyBhYm91\r\ndCAK4oCcV29ya2Zsb3cgd2l0aCBnaXTigJwuIEFkbWl0dGVkbHksIHRoaXMgaXMgbm90IFItc3Bl\r\nY2lmaWMsIGJ1dCBpbnRlZ3JhdGlvbgogd2l0aCBSc3R1ZGlvIG1ha2VzIHRoZSBlbnRyeS1lZmZv\r\ncnQgYSBsaXR0bGUgZWFzaWVyLiBJ4oCZbGwgZGlzY3VzcyBzb21lIApvZiB0aGUgYmFzaWMgY29u\r\nY2VwdHMgb2YgdmVyc2lvbiBjb250cm9sIChlLmcuLCBjb21taXQsIGRpZmYsIGJyYW5jaCwgCmZv\r\ncmspIGFuZCBiYXNpYyB3b3JrZmxvdyBmcm9tIHN0YXJ0aW5nIGEgbmV3IHJlcG8gdG8gZG9pbmcg\r